  "groups": [
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "retains a HIPAA Safeguards Certification",
          "item": "e_001cd0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "nursing personnel infection control training rate ≥ 85%",
          "item": "e_008afe"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Note:** The JSON above follows the required format `{"groups": [{...}, {...}]}` with each group containing an `all_of` list of conditions and their corresponding candidate IDs.
